{"role": "user", "text": "意思是我们把调试线插电脑上录日志然后再回到设备上吗？\n", "ts": "2026-11-03T09:16:49.771Z", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "metadata": {"source_line": 9472, "source_record_sha256": "19d29409a093d1c6d12dde45fa7a6b622fb6689d912343d06a17f1436417fb88"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a19a88-1ab7-7c10-a3db-a3450cbf218e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 3794}
{"role": "assistant", "text": "对，**先拍电脑上的启动日志，再拍设备演示**，可以分成两个片段。\n\n- **第一段**：接串口调试线读取真实启动日志，开发板仍由独立电源供电。\n- **第二段**：拍清楚拔掉电脑连接线，再将主板和 STM32 断电、重新独立上电，连续展示配网、问答、跟随和测肤。\n\n这样第二段能明确证明设备脱离电脑也能工作。**调试线是否会供电，我们录之前先核对，不能把电脑供电误当成独立供电。**", "ts": "2026-11-03T09:16:57.870Z", "model": "gpt-6.1-sol", "metadata": {"source_line": 9475, "source_record_sha256": "14c8b4440fb7d5ca646a1ab5f583bdda4ddc87aab40ff50da55b56ec3e29958a"}, "redacted_count": 0, "schema_version": "1.0", "session_id": "01a19a88-1ab7-7c10-a3db-a3450cbf218e", "team_id": "contest2026_483_yuanxinshixisheng", "github_login": "maomaojiang01", "tool": "codex", "seq": 3795}
